B.RF=new A.fy(" \ud83d\udce6 Dart Package - Enchanted Collection toolkit ","\ud83d\udca1 A collection toolkit of useful data structures and algorithms for collections.\n\n<b>List utilities<b>\n \u29bf forEach mapper\n \u29bf mapper\n \u29bf singleWhereOrNull\n \u29bf Insert in index\n \u29bf Change element in index\n \u29bf Add value as the last element of a list\n \u29bf Split into groups\n \u29bf Detect mixed null / non-null content\n \u29bf Remove null elements from a list\n\n<b>Map utilities<b>\n \u29bf Try-cast a map with null fallback\n\n<b>Cast helpers<b>\n \u29bf Transform a list into a map\n \u29bf Transform a list into a map with a mapper\n \u29bf Transform a map into a list\n \u29bf Cast object / dynamic to a desired type","\ud83d\udca1 A <b>collection toolkit<b> with useful data structures and algorithms for day-to-day Dart collections.\n\n<soft>List utilities, map helpers and casting helpers in one place.<soft>  ","art/tumbnails/packages/enchanted_collection.PNG","https://pub.dev/packages/enchanted_collection",A.aV9(),B.l6,200,200,B.bR,B.aR,B.dk,null,!1,null)
