B.RP=new A.fy(" \ud83d\udce6 Flutter Package - Field autocomplete  ","\ud83d\udca1 Autocomplete dialog in a text field for desktop applications.\n\n<soft>Flutter already has an <autocompleteWidget>autocomplete widget<autocompleteWidget>,<soft> but the default experience does not match the expected UI pattern commonly seen on desktop and web. This package makes it possible to display an <b>overlay list of options right below the cursor indicator<b>, with each autocomplete option rendered as a list tile.","\ud83d\udca1 Autocomplete dialog in a text field for <b>desktop applications<b>.\n\n<soft>Flutter already has an <autocompleteWidget>autocomplete widget<autocompleteWidget>,<soft> but it does not match the expected UI pattern commonly seen on desktop and web.  ","art/tumbnails/packages/cursor_autocomplete.JPEG","https://pub.dev/packages/cursor_autocomplete_options",A.aV6(),B.U5,200,260,B.O5,B.aR,B.LB,null,!1,null)
